{
  "body": "**Mondo term (ID and Label):**\nMONDO:0957382 multiple mitochondrial dysfunctions syndrome 7 \n\n**Suggested new label:**\nGCSH-related glycine encephalopathy\n\n**Your nano-attribution (ORCID)**\n0000-0002-7437-8060\n\n**_Optional_: Any additional information (like supporting evidence, PubMed ID, etc.)**\nThis is the ClinGen preferred label from the Aminoacidopathy GCEP\n\n",
  "comments": [
    {
      "id": "IC_kwDOBjach88AAAABAwN3lQ",
      "author": {
        "login": "MeeSiing"
      },
      "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
      "body": "Hi @justyneross, thank you for the ticket.\n\nWe need more info before we can proceed because the proposed label creates a scope issue. There is currently a term [MONDO:0011612 'glycine encephalopathy'](https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols4/ontologies/mondo/classes/http%253A%252F%252Fpurl.obolibrary.org%252Fobo%252FMONDO_0011612), and your term appears to be specific and may fit better as a child under this term.\n\nPlease clarify the concept you intend to represent- a syndrome as MONDO:0957382 or specific to glycine encephalopathy as MONDO:0011612. \n\nThanks. ",
      "createdAt": "2026-04-29T16:18:03Z",
      "includesCreatedEdit": true,
      "isMinimized": false,
      "minimizedReason": "",
      "reactionGroups": [],
      "url": "https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9896#issuecomment-4345526165",
      "viewerDidAuthor": false
    }
  ],
  "title": "GCSH-related glycine encephalopathy",
  "url": "https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9896"
}

